Specification References:
1.  3GPP TS 38.472: "NG-RAN; F1 signalling transport" (for F1-C SCTP port).
2.  3GPP TS 38.462: "NG-RAN; E1 signalling transport" (for E1-C SCTP port).
3.  3GPP TS 38.474: "NG-RAN; F1 interface: data transport and transport signalling" (for F1-U user plane).
4.  3GPP TS 29.281: "General Packet Radio System (GPRS) Tunnelling Protocol User Plane (GTPv1-U)" (for GTP-U port).
5.  3GPP TS 33.501: "Security architecture and procedures for 5G System" (for ciphering and integrity algorithms, DRB security).
6.  3GPP TS 38.300: "NR; Overall description; Stage 2" (for DRB security).

