1.  Change `local_s_portc = 501;` to `local_s_portc = 38472;`
2.  Change `port_cuup = 38462;` to `port_cuup = 2152;`
3.  Change `ciphering_algorithms = ( "nea0" );` to `ciphering_algorithms = ( "nea2" );`
